 of membership.\n\nSlot allocation is based on the order of candidate responses. To ensure fairness and better coordination, when a registered candidate cancels their slot, the administrator will send a separate notification to all candidates each time slots open. Due to limited availability, places will be allocated on a first-come, first-served basis based on response time.\n\n\\*If you need to cancel your participation, please notify the administrator at least 24 hours before the event. Late cancellations will incur venue fees. Thank you for your understanding and cooperation.\n\n\\*To ensure fairness and transparency, each participant needs to confirm individually. Members who fail to cancel their registration and complete payment within the specified time will be permanently disqualified.\n\nPlease note that if you confirm participation on behalf of another member, you will be responsible for that member's event costs.\n\nTo maintain fairness for all participants, please inform your friends that they must also confirm.\n\n\\*In the event of repeated violations, the administrator reserves the right to make the final decision.\n\nThank you for your understanding and cooperation.\n\n* After reading the event details, members can contact the administrator via message.","startDate":"2026-10-10T13:30:00.000Z","endDate":"","eventStatus":"https://schema.org/EventScheduled","image":"/images/fallbacks/redesign/group-cover-2-square.webp","eventAttendanceMode":"https://schema.org/OfflineEventAttendanceMode","location":{"@type":"Place","name":"CA Badminton Academy","address":{"@type":"PostalAddress","addressLocality":"Scarborough","addressRegion":"ON","addressCountry":"ca","streetAddress":"1370 Birchmount rd, unit 6, Scarborough, ON"}},"organizer":{"@type":"Organization","name":"CA Badminton Meetup Toronto Group GTA","url":"https://www.meetup.com/ca-badminton-meetup-toronto-group-gta/"},"performer":"CA Badminton Meetup Toronto Group GTA"},{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Event","name":"The Ultimate 80s and 90s Saturday Night Dance Bash! (October 10th)","url":"https://www.meetup.com/soulcity/events/316602212/","description":"Good day everyone,\n\nGet ready to turn back the clock and dance the night away to some of the greatest music of the 80s and 90s!\n\nJoin us for a energy filled Saturday night at The Phesant filled with great music, dancing, laughs and a fun crowd.\n\n\\*Joined by my other social groups too; so we can anticipate a fabulous turn out with lots of friendly peers to begin our weekend with!\n\n\\*Please note we are at **The Pheasant: A Firkin Pub** at 1999 Avenue Road (roughly 6 blocks north of Lawrence - south of the 401 **(we are in the back dining area to find us)**\n\n*\\*You can also ask the wait staff or bartender if you like to show you to the group (simply ask for Steve's games event)*\n\n**-Free Parking found on residential side streets**\n\n(Event Details Below)\n\nSincerely,\n\nDJ Steve Flemming\n(Organizer/Host )\n\nEvent Details:\n**The Ultimate 80s and 90s Saturday Night Dance Bash!**\n\nDJ Steve Flemming will be playing a great mix of familiar favourites from two unforgettable decades.\n\n• Dance to 80s and 90s favourites with songs that bring back some great memories\n• Enjoy a fun party atmosphere with disco lights, music and plenty of room to dance\n• Mix and mingle with new people and familiar faces throughout the evening\n• Come on your own or bring a friend — just arrive ready for a fun Saturday night!\n\n**Event Fee: $5**\nPayment can be made **in cash at the event** or **in advance by e-transfer to [SteveFlemming11@gmail.com](mailto:SteveFlemming11@gmail.com)**\nIf paying by e-transfer, please include **your name** in the message so your payment can be easily identified.\n\nCome join us, hit the dance floor and enjoy a Saturday night filled with music, memories and good company!\n\n***\n\n**Friendly Reminders:**\n\n-Arrive any time between 8:30 pm and 10:00 pm (if you can)\n(arrive earlier if you like)\n\n\\*Great dinner menu and food specials provided:\n(One beverage or appetizer minimum upon arrival to support venue)\n\n**Parking and Transportation:**\n\\*Lots of street parking on avenue and free residential parking\nhttps://www.firkinpubs.com/thepheasantandfirkin/\n\n(15-20 minute walk from Yonge & Lawrence subway station-or simply take bus or uber from the station)","startDate":"2026-10-11T00:30:00.000Z","endDate":"","eventStatus":"https://schema.org/EventScheduled","image":"/images/fallbacks/redesign/group-cover-1-square.webp","eventAttendanceMode":"https://schema.org/OfflineEventAttendanceMode","location":{"@type":"Place","name":"The Pheasant: A Firkin Pub","address":{"@type":"PostalAddress","addressLocality":"North York","addressRegion":"ON","addressCountry":"ca","streetAddress":"1999 Avenue Rd, North York, ON"}},"organizer":{"@type":"Organization","name":"Soul City Social Club (Toronto, Canada)","url":"https://www.meetup.com/soulcity/"},"performer":"Soul City Social Club (Toronto, Canada)"},{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Event","name":"Thanks Giving Dance Party + 40 Crowd @ The Old Mill","url":"https://www.meetup.com/singlespartiescom/events/316483054/","description":"Singles Dance Party + 40 Crowd\n\n**Saturday October 10th**\n7.30pm -12.30\n**The Old Mill**\n**21 Old Mill Rd.**\nJoin us for a fabulous a Saturday night of Dancing & Romancing . We have a great DJ playing all your favorite tunes from the 70’s to the present. It’s your opportunity to mix, mingle, enjoy a few dances and meet some new friends. You can dance the night away on their big dance floor. Please, no running shoes or jeans. The cover is only $20.00. 416- 236- 8222\nHope to see you then! Singles Dance Party + 40 Crowd","startDate":"2026-10-10T23:30:00.000Z","endDate":"","eventStatus":"https://schema.org/EventScheduled","image":"/images/fallbacks/redesign/group-cover-2-square.webp","eventAttendanceMode":"https://schema.org/OfflineEventAttendanceMode","location":{"@type":"Place","name":"The Old Mill","address":{"@type":"PostalAddress","addressLocality":"toronto","addressRegion":"ON","addressCountry":"ca","streetAddress":"21 Old Mill rd, toronto, ON"}},"organizer":{"@type":"Organization","name":"SinglesParties.com","url":"https://www.meetup.com/singlespartiescom/"},"performer":"SinglesParties.com"},{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Event","name":" Fall Walk: Finch Recreational Trail & Park Adventure! 🌾🚶‍♂️ (16KM) ","url":"https://www.meetup.com/no-such-thing-as-bad-weather/events/316182428/","description":"# 🍁 Fall Walk: Finch Recreational Trail & Park Adventure! 🌾\n\n### An Easy, Flat Fall Walk Through Toronto's Green Spaces\n\nLooking for an easy way to enjoy the fall colours without tackling a difficult hike?\nJoin us for a relaxed walk from **Pioneer Village Station to Finch Station**, travelling through Black Creek Parkland and along the **Finch Recreational Trail**.\n\nThis is one of our members' favourite walks for a reason. The route is mostly flat and takes us through open fields, wooded areas, and quiet green spaces that feel surprisingly far removed from the city.\n\nWe'll take our time, enjoy the changing leaves, stop for a break by **Dufferin Creek**, and spend the day walking and getting to know each other.\n\n📱 Don't forget to join our **WhatsApp Group – [CLICK HERE](https://chat.whatsapp.com/H59mSCbsAi018gYANrKAnc)**\n\n***\n\n## 🚶‍♂️ What We'll Do\n\nWe'll start outside **Pioneer Village Station** and make our way through Black Creek Parkland before joining the Finch Recreational Trail.\nAlong the way we'll:\n\n* Walk through Black Creek Parkland 🌳\n* Follow the Finch Recreational Trail\n* Enjoy the fall colours and changing scenery 🍂\n* Stop for a break near Dufferin Creek\n* Have some time for conversation and photos\n* Continue along the trail toward Finch Station\n\nThis is a **long but easy, mostly flat walk**. There are no major hills or difficult terrain, but you'll want comfortable shoes and enough energy for the full route.\n\n***\n\n## 🍂 Fall Is the Best Time to Do This Walk\n\nThere's something particularly nice about this trail in the fall. The air is cooler, the leaves are changing, and the open stretches of the trail give you plenty of room to slow down and enjoy the season.\nIt's a good walk if you want to get outside without feeling like you're climbing a mountain.\nAnd as always, **the activity is the container. The people you meet along the way are the real experience.**\n\n***\n\n## 🧢 Meetup Details\n\n📍 **Meetup Location:** Outside Pioneer Village Station, at the corner of Steeles Avenue West and Northwest Gate (East Side), in front of the York University sign.\n🫎 **Look for me in my Moose Hat!**\n⏰ **Meetup Time:** 11:00 AM sharp\nI will only wait **5 minutes**.\n**Early is on time. On time is late.**\n🏁 **End Point:** Finch Station\n\n***\n\n## 🎟️ Meetup Fee\n\n**$5 cash in person or e-transfer**\n📧 **mathewmaclean@hotmail.com**\nThis fee helps support the group and allows us to continue organizing events throughout Toronto.\n\n***\n\n## 🎒 What to Bring\n\n💧 Water\n👟 Comfortable walking shoes\n🥪 A snack or light lunch\n🧥 A fall jacket or sweater\n\n***\n\n## 🌈 Who Is This For?\n\nThis walk is great for:\n\n* Anyone who enjoys fall scenery\n* People looking for an easy, flat trail\n* Anyone who wants to get back into walking\n* People who enjoy exploring Toronto's green spaces\n* Anyone looking for a relaxed social outing\n* People who want to meet new people while getting some fresh air\n\nYou're welcome to RSVP ahead of time or just show up on the day if you're unsure about your schedule.\nSometimes things happen and events may need to be cancelled or changed, so please keep an eye on the event page for updates.\n\n👤 **Organizer: Mathew**\nQuestions? Post on the event wall or email **torontomoviesandoutings@hotmail.com**.\n\n**Come for the fall colours.**\n**Stay for the friendship.** 🍁💛","startDate":"2026-10-10T15:00:00.000Z","endDate":"","eventStatus":"https://schema.org/EventScheduled","image":"/images/fallbacks/redesign/group-cover-1-square.webp","eventAttendanceMode":"https://schema.org/OfflineEventAttendanceMode","location":{"@type":"Place","name":"Steeles Avenue West and Northwest Gate (East Side)","address":{"@type":"PostalAddress","addressLocality":"Toronto","addressRegion":"ON","addressCountry":"ca","streetAddress":"Vaughan, ON L4K 4N5, Toronto, ON"}},"organizer":{"@type":"Organization","name":"No Such Thing As Bad Weather Walking & Hiking Group!","url":"https://www.meetup.com/no-such-thing-as-bad-weather/"},"performer":"No Such Thing As Bad Weather Walking & Hiking Group!"}]</script><link rel="preload" href="https://secure.meetupstatic.com/photos/event/c/f/b/9/highres_536153177.jpeg" as="image" data-next-head=""/><link rel="preload" href="https://secure.meetupstatic.com/photos/event/a/4/3/highres_530222627.jpeg" as="image" data-next-head=""/><link rel="preload" href="https://secure.meetupstatic.com/photos/event/3/3/6/3/highres_529513155.jpeg" as="image" data-next-head=""/><link rel="preload" href="https://secure.meetupstatic.com/photos/event/4/b/6/highres_509641206.jpeg" as="image" data-next-head=""/><link rel="preload" href="https://secure.meetupstatic.com/photos/event/a/c/8/a/highres_536144170.jpeg" as="image" data-next-head=""/><link rel="preload" href="https://secure.meetupstatic.com/photos/event/9/1/0/5/highres_535717125.jpeg" as="image" data-next-head=""/><link rel="preload" href="https://secure.meetupstatic.com/photos/event/1/0/f/0/highres_523744336.jpeg" as="image" data-next-head=""/><link rel="preload" href="https://secure.meetupstatic.com/photos/event/a/0/3/c/highres_536081020.jpeg" as="image" data-next-head=""/><link rel="preload" href="https://secure.meetupstatic.com/photos/event/3/9/9/7/highres_507254743.jpeg" as="image" data-next-head=""/><link rel="preload" href="https://secure.meetupstatic.com/photos/event/6/e/2/8/highres_536188200.jpeg" as="image" data-next-head=""/><link