nGet ready to turn back the clock and dance the night away to some of the greatest music of the 80s and 90s!\n\nJoin us for a energy filled Saturday night at The Phesant filled with great music, dancing, laughs and a fun crowd.\n\n\\*Joined by my other social groups too; so we can anticipate a fabulous turn out with lots of friendly peers to begin our weekend with!\n\n\\*Please note we are at **The Pheasant: A Firkin Pub** at 1999 Avenue Road (roughly 6 blocks north of Lawrence - south of the 401 **(we are in the back dining area to find us)**\n\n*\\*You can also ask the wait staff or bartender if you like to show you to the group (simply ask for Steve's games event)*\n\n**-Free Parking found on residential side streets**\n\n(Event Details Below)\n\nSincerely,\n\nDJ Steve Flemming\n(Organizer/Host )\n\nEvent Details:\n**The Ultimate 80s and 90s Saturday Night Dance Bash!**\n\nDJ Steve Flemming will be playing a great mix of familiar favourites from two unforgettable decades.\n\n• Dance to 80s and 90s favourites with songs that bring back some great memories\n• Enjoy a fun party atmosphere with disco lights, music and plenty of room to dance\n• Mix and mingle with new people and familiar faces throughout the evening\n• Come on your own or bring a friend — just arrive ready for a fun Saturday night!\n\n**Event Fee: $5**\nPayment can be made **in cash at the event** or **in advance by e-transfer to [SteveFlemming11@gmail.com](mailto:SteveFlemming11@gmail.com)**\nIf paying by e-transfer, please include **your name** in the message so your payment can be easily identified.\n\nCome join us, hit the dance floor and enjoy a Saturday night filled with music, memories and good company!\n\n***\n\n**Friendly Reminders:**\n\n-Arrive any time between 8:30 pm and 10:00 pm (if you can)\n(arrive earlier if you like)\n\n\\*Great dinner menu and food specials provided:\n(One beverage or appetizer minimum upon arrival to support venue)\n\n**Parking and Transportation:**\n\\*Lots of str